WEBVTT

00:00:00.121 --> 00:00:05.765
Creating an admission enquiry

00:00:05.815 --> 00:00:10.128
Open Admissions and Enquiries, then press New Enquiry.

00:00:19.575 --> 00:00:22.469
Enter the student name and the father name.

00:00:30.291 --> 00:00:33.864
Enter the mobile number and choose the grade applied for.

00:00:39.509 --> 00:00:43.173
Choose how the family found you, and add a note.

00:00:51.402 --> 00:00:56.236
Press Create Enquiry. It appears in the list with status New.

00:00:59.637 --> 00:01:04.310
Enquiry saved
